### Register Guardian
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "guardian@test.com",
  "password": "password123",
  "role": "guardian"
}

###

### Login Guardian
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "guardian@test.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

###

